This folder is intentionally left empty in the repository.

Put the real CC0 model files here before running the game:

- /public/assets/models/shelf.glb
- /public/assets/models/fridge.glb
- /public/assets/models/checkout.glb
- /public/assets/models/cart.glb
- /public/assets/models/customer_walk.glb

Optional additional files:
- /public/assets/models/customer_idle.glb
- /public/assets/textures/
- /public/assets/hdr/

Recommended sources:
- Kenney: https://www.kenney.nl/assets
- Quaternius: https://quaternius.com/
- Poly Pizza: https://poly.pizza/
- Poly Haven: https://polyhaven.com/
- ambientCG: https://ambientcg.com/

If you use the models from those sources, keep them in the public/assets path to be served by Vite.
